{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>《九運會客室2》節目男主持Brian因頻繁爆粗備受網民爭議，圈內藝人對此行徑卻抱持截然不同態度。他近日在網上節目中大爆猛料，坦承自己滿口粗言穢語其實是向一位知名影后偷師！ </p>\n<h2>粗口Brian親自剖白銅鑼灣街頭向影后偷師學爆粗</h2>\n<p>男主持Brian近期在網上節目《24/7 Talk》中閒談期間，突然親自解開網民對他粗泛濫口疑惑。他憶述多年前在銅鑼灣皇室堡遇到一名港女高聲講電話，全程操流利廣東話粗言穢語，讓他驚覺粗口居然有這種表達方式，感嘆港式粗口「原來可以咁樣用」。他回頭一看才赫然，發現對方正是影后張柏芝，同場主持笑指這番言論恐怕要遭自我審查刪減，最終片段仍如常對外公開。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542808669933089_1361798856b040ef777f18.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-23 下午5.31.16.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542808669933089_1361798856b040ef777f18.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Brian憶述當日街頭聽到影后講電話，粗口的應用方式令他大開眼界。（圖片來源：《24/7 Talk》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542808942739072_10290341236b040ef9c022a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"RTay2uTZ0DyJowki5hd5vhNpOqaInbOhNlzf3zZc398.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542808942739072_10290341236b040ef9c022a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>張柏芝比Brian年輕6歲，私下豪邁作風坊間不時略有所聞，但貴為影后幕前風格與Brian截然不同，（圖片來源：《忘不了》劇照）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>陳展鵬罕有發聲直指粗言穢語屬「廣東話精髓」</h2>\n<p>圈中出名是愛妻號兼好爸爸演員陳展鵬對Brian的爆粗作風展現出超乎想像包容度。他早前曾在社交平台轉發Brian訪問片段，強烈認同粗言穢語是「廣東話文化精髓」，只要用於表達情緒而非鬧人便沒有問題。他更發文直言<b><strong>「有太多PK掩飾自己唔講粗口」</strong></b>，大膽言論令大批網民感到震驚，甚至有人留言跪求他親自錄製爆粗語音檔作生日禮物。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542809113593342_20367034366b040efbbc217.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TVB視帝轉發Brian訪問力撐「粗口文化」炮轟虛偽人士 網民一爆笑要求引熱議/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542809113593342_20367034366b040efbbc217.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：網絡截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>馮德倫錄影節目難忍連番不雅字眼面露難色</h2>\n<p>另一邊廂馮德倫面對這種極致粗口文化卻顯得相當抗拒。早前Brian錄影節目大談日本漫畫《去吧！稻中乒團》時，全程毫無顧忌地狂爆極度不雅字眼。馮德倫聽後瞬間面露尷尬神色，更忍不住當場反問對方「你以前係咪咁多粗口？」 大批觀眾事後亦批評該集充滿災難級粗俗言詞，嚴重影響觀感並完全蓋過原本應有內容。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542809340894002_13775538026b040efdbb589.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6a733ef618f8c7.78965454.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542809340894002_13775538026b040efdbb589.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>馮德倫對住Brian粗口泛濫的主持風格面露難食。（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>前輩夏文汐受訪被惹怒當場直斥拍檔準備不足</h2>\n<p>60歲資深女星夏文汐獲邀上節目時完全無法忍受這種災難級表現。Brian不僅坦承未曾觀看她去年熱播劇集《新聞女王2》，更聲稱看過她參演《寒戰1994》。一向優雅從容夏文汐當場直斥伍姑娘拍檔「唔掂」，並開口奉勸「呢套你又冇聽過，冇睇過？咁你要睇返。」。事件隨即在Threads及YouTube引發洗版式聲討，網民強烈要求電視台順應民意剔除男主持。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542809416320602_16670116616b040efe89926.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"孖伍詠薇主持惹公憤 Brian零功課狂爆粗 夏文汐頂唔順當場呻「唔掂」/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542809416320602_16670116616b040efe89926.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>廿四味李凱賢自幼移居香港屢創網絡爆紅金句</h2>\n<p>惹起全城熱議李凱賢本身是著名Hip Hop組合廿四味成員兼電影演員。出身印尼華僑家庭他在1985年以11歲之齡隨家人移居香港，其後曾赴日本東京修讀日文。他於2025年底至2026年初期間，在網上以中英夾雜及誇張生動方式點評燒味，成功創造出「Hermès版叉燒」等爆紅金句。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/17721028138258531_213551602469a0249e2a3ab.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"楊偲泳 夜王 （圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1HK）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/17721028138258531_213551602469a0249e2a3ab.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Brian曾經出言不遜形容張振朗女友身材，引起不少風波。（圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1HK）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176896556395778587_937704691697045bc4aad8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"廿四味 brian （圖片來源：IG相片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176896556395778587_937704691697045bc4aad8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T10:24:05.367647+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1441,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:01:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T10:17:24.190156+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T10:17:24.190156+00:00","content_hash":"8daebd2807be52bd53d1a49e0bbfa4f9a99e12b15e32aef67b0552651d024dc6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}